    "date": "2026-05-19",
    "topic": "Prosperous States for a Prosperous India - Speech by Dr. Poonam Gupta, Deputy Governor, Reserve Bank of India, delivered at the ‘Columbia Indian Economy Summit 2026’ at the Raj Centre on Indian Economic Policy at Columbia University on April 11, 2026 - ",
    "topicTag": "Economy",
